<title>USA: Carolina First Corp sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Carolina First Corp sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carolina First Corp on Tuesday announced a six-for-five stock split in the form of a 20 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend is issuable January 30 to shareholders of record January 15, the company said.</p>
</text>
